r-field/id #uuid "be46bfd5-995a-56a0-b587-dc0b01e32cd9" :answer-field/key "$A(x,y,z)=(x+y)\\,\\mathbf i+z\\,\\mathbf j+x\\,\\mathbf k$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707712} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "84bf1ba6-e713-5080-916d-e869ef27ec83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707704} {:answer/id #uuid "98f7cb2c-aca9-5144-831b-94b07e79f46e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707707}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "98f7cb2c-aca9-5144-831b-94b07e79f46e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707707} :answer-field/id #uuid "faeb1d69-602d-58b4-97fe-ae53dc4a1cb8" :answer-field/key "$B(x,y)=x\\,\\mathbf i+y\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707719}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4a23448d-e525-59d0-99a6-6b5ef32b96e6" :question/problem "A vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$ assigns a vector in $\\mathbb R^3$ to each point of a subset of $\\mathbb R^3$.\n\nWhich of the following are vector fields on $\\mathbb R^3$? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Check both the input points and the output vectors.\n\n- $A$ takes a point $(x,y,z)$ and returns the three-component vector $\\langle x+y,z,x\\rangle$. Its components are defined for all real $x,y,z$, so it is a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n- $B$ takes a point $(x,y)$ in $\\mathbb R^2$ and returns a vector in $\\mathbb R^2$. It is not a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n- $C$ returns a vector with three components, but its input is a single real parameter $t$. It describes a vector-valued function of one variable, not a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n\nSelect $A$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707699 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "60190ee9-8a69-5873-943d-08516c075bf8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707698} {:answer/id #uuid "bfb0001a-5327-569d-8596-6930ae9079a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707713}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "60190ee9-8a69-5873-943d-08516c075bf8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707698} :answer-field/id #uuid "3a5759d0-6bed-5010-a4a8-4adefb599c6e" :answer-field/key "$F(x,y,z)=xy+z^2$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707694} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27b15858-66db-5ec0-a457-c996c8e779d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707692} {:answer/id #uuid "90a0d32f-06bc-5124-935b-c2ebc8679f12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707706}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "90a0d32f-06bc-5124-935b-c2ebc8679f12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707706} :answer-field/id #uuid "6e28ec9f-6f09-5422-b022-ec4dcd85304f" :answer-field/key "$D(x,y,z)=\\begin{bmatrix}xy \\\\ y-z \\\\ \\frac{1}{x+1}\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707701} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5074c82a-3642-5fdb-9932-b201ac769a30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707697} {:answer/id #uuid "dcbf4d1e-fc46-5eb6-b172-5e6c728859c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707716}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dcbf4d1e-fc46-5eb6-b172-5e6c728859c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707716} :answer-field/id #uuid "a9632674-991a-5aba-9b3a-ebfbe33b5099" :answer-field/key "$E(x,y)=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ x+y\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707710}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6167192b-5781-5758-8af1-7bb5031bf54f" :question/problem "Which of the following are vector fields on $\\mathbb R^3$? Use each function's natural real domain. Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$ must take three-dimensional points as inputs and return vectors in $\\mathbb R^3$. A restricted domain is allowed.\n\n- $D$ takes $(x,y,z)$ and returns a column vector with three components. The denominator requires $x\\ne-1$, so its domain is\n$$\nS_D=\\{(x,y,z)\\in\\mathbb R^3\\mid x\\ne-1\\}.\n$$\nIt is a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n- $E$ returns three components, but takes only $(x,y)$ as input. Its domain is $\\mathbb R^2$, so it is not a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$ as given. A three-component output does not turn a two-coordinate input into a three-coordinate input.\n- $F$ takes three coordinates but returns the scalar $xy+z^2$, not a vector in $\\mathbb R^3$. It is a scalar-valued function, not a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n\nSelect $D$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707714 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "38c3cfd4-183a-5364-b598-6e6e4185fe18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707693} {:answer/id #uuid "f09b3aff-da5e-5814-bfbf-2f4621d7aebd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707718}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f09b3aff-da5e-5814-bfbf-2f4621d7aebd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707718} :answer-field/id #uuid "9eb25ef1-ceb4-540f-9939-fa5dd70406ad" :answer-field/key "$H(x,y,z)=\\langle\\ln z,\\sqrt{x-y}\\rangle$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707708} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4400488d-7de3-5836-8aa3-f80469fc33c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707695} {:answer/id #uuid "9fa166de-ecc3-5678-9e26-51f94e8b2ec7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707709}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9fa166de-ecc3-5678-9e26-51f94e8b2ec7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707709} :answer-field/id #uuid "b5e47416-93f8-5630-b413-35dea96203bf" :answer-field/key "$K(x,y,z)=\\langle0,\\frac{1}{x-y},0\\rangle$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707711} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "27079f2f-7be1-5067-8e2b-e829add3bf40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707691} {:answer/id #uuid "75c3ece3-5a8f-52ec-b797-9f846269096b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707702}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "27079f2f-7be1-5067-8e2b-e829add3bf40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707691} :answer-field/id #uuid "d77df541-bb67-51bc-9887-c94e49bee9c3" :answer-field/key "$G(x,y,z)=\\ln z\\,\\mathbf i+\\sqrt{x-y}\\,\\mathbf j$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707715}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "c917512f-1ebc-5329-adea-d2539389904c" :question/problem "Here $\\mathbf i,\\mathbf j,\\mathbf k$ are the standard unit vectors in $\\mathbb R^3$. Use each function's natural real domain.\n\nWhich of the following are vector fields on $\\mathbb R^3$? Select all that apply." :question/worked-solution "All three functions take points $(x,y,z)$ as inputs. Now determine what kind of output each expression actually represents.\n\n- $G$ is written using the standard unit vectors of $\\mathbb R^3$. The missing $\\mathbf k$ term has coefficient zero, so\n$$\nG(x,y,z)=\\langle\\ln z,\\sqrt{x-y},0\\rangle.\n$$\nIts domain is\n$$\nS_G=\\{(x,y,z)\\in\\mathbb R^3\\mid z>0,\\ x\\ge y\\}.\n$$\nThus $G$ assigns a vector in $\\mathbb R^3$ to each point of $S_G$. Its outputs lying in the $xy$-plane does not prevent it from being a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n- $H$ explicitly returns an ordered pair, $\\langle\\ln z,\\sqrt{x-y}\\rangle$, in $\\mathbb R^2$. It has the same domain restrictions as $G$, but it is not a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$ as written. An ordered pair does not acquire an extra coordinate automatically.\n- $K$ explicitly returns an ordered triple. Its domain is\n$$\nS_K=\\{(x,y,z)\\in\\mathbb R^3\\mid x\\ne y\\}.\n$$\nFor each point in this set, $K$ returns $\\langle0,1/(x-y),0\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R^3$. Zero components and independence from $z$ do not change its three-coordinate input or its three-component output. It is a vector field on $\\mathbb R^3$.\n\nSelect $G$ and $K$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707894 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "37538f54-b456-5a4f-a75c-1adeb7425747" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\mathbb R^2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707902} {:answer/id #uuid "417db6ab-a8a7-5507-885d-17aa4455a66f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} = 6\\\\&x \\neq 2\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707904} {:answer/id #uuid "8340a4ce-7e0d-5e33-b445-c80bd74ad8ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\geq 6\\\\&x \\neq 2\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707913} {:answer/id #uuid "99ac01c8-a22c-5b9a-a9f1-ef4eee14f043" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 6\\\\&x > 2\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707916} {:answer/id #uuid "a909ae6a-3b7a-5b50-b116-fdf6ec641fb3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 6\\\\&x \\neq 2\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707920}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a909ae6a-3b7a-5b50-b116-fdf6ec641fb3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 6\\\\&x \\neq 2\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707920} :answer-field/id #uuid "62eb4c87-0a5b-5499-a326-a41e86f8050c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707907}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0ae5fe1b-4a08-5d4a-a07b-0579d4a5edf7" :question/problem "Determine the domain of the real vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\frac{x y}{x - 2}\\,i+\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x^{2} + y^{2} - 6} \\right)}\\right)\\,j.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Write $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(x,y)&=\\frac{x y}{x - 2}\\\\Q(x,y)&=\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x^{2} + y^{2} - 6} \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nP: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $x - 2 \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_P=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x \\neq 2\\right\\}$.\n\nQ: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $x^{2} + y^{2} - 6 \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_Q=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 6\\right\\}$.\n\nThe domain is the intersection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D&=D_P\\cap D_Q\\\\&=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 6\\\\&x \\neq 2\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707901 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46f3e7a3-041f-5398-a363-75855696812b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 y > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707905} {:answer/id #uuid "6d0887ea-d496-5187-8891-3256bdf05f23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\mathbb R^2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707908} {:answer/id #uuid "715af7ac-e6db-57a3-8e6e-ad3ddb1e280c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 y = 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707910} {:answer/id #uuid "a6e94823-4391-5899-9bde-644a8e885e04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 y \\leq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707919} {:answer/id #uuid "ec19401d-fad1-5d0a-bce0-2754ea9e5f2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,3 x + y > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707926}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46f3e7a3-041f-5398-a363-75855696812b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 y > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707905} :answer-field/id #uuid "b7c54c6b-57c8-5653-bb25-a20572fe4663" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707923}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3747e6ac-56b5-5ca4-ab15-9139acae9313" :question/problem "Determine the domain of the real vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\ln{\\left(x + 3 y \\right)}\\,i+\\left(\\frac{1}{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\right)\\,j.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Write $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(x,y)&=\\ln{\\left(x + 3 y \\right)}\\\\Q(x,y)&=\\frac{1}{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nP: The logarithm argument must be strictly positive.\n\nThe required conditions are $x + 3 y > 0$.\n\nThus $D_P=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 y > 0\\right\\}$.\n\nQ: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_Q=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}$.\n\nThe logarithm's strict inequality already excludes the origin. The domain is the intersection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D&=D_P\\cap D_Q\\\\&=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 y > 0\\right\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707909 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1220c7a7-5247-5330-bcb4-9780cd35e8b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707895} {:answer/id #uuid "797d5670-37d1-5e81-a186-9dcf456c356d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} < 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707912} {:answer/id #uuid "95bde751-a084-572c-b3f8-100d3bd9dcb5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y \\neq \\frac{5 x}{2}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707915} {:answer/id #uuid "9d94587c-4735-5a85-9ca3-714d85a835e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707917} {:answer/id #uuid "a2170726-9128-51e5-a77d-00a9f82a91ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 4 x^{2} + 25 y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707918}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9d94587c-4735-5a85-9ca3-714d85a835e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707917} :answer-field/id #uuid "742e6895-02e7-5915-b82e-6424e03b4110" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707911}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6dcd3d89-11be-5dfa-a016-93d7313c56b6" :question/problem "Determine the domain of the real vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\frac{x}{25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2}}\\,i+\\left(\\frac{\\left(-1\\right) y}{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\right)\\,j.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Write $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(x,y)&=\\frac{x}{25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2}}\\\\Q(x,y)&=\\frac{\\left(-1\\right) y}{x^{2} + y^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nP: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} \\neq 0$.\n\nFactor the denominator: $25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2}=\\left(5 x - 2 y\\right) \\left(5 x + 2 y\\right)$.\n\nThus $D_P=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}$.\n\nQ: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_Q=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}$.\n\nThe origin lies on both excluded lines, so removing those lines already removes the origin. The domain is the intersection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D&=D_P\\cap D_Q\\\\&=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,25 x^{2} - 4 y^{2} \\neq 0\\right\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
